<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten meal prices steady - weak.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten meal prices steady - weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten meal values were steady to lower, while feed values were unchanged. Dealers said demand was easing for gluten, which was normal in the summer.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	    unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   79.00     79.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  350.00    350.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   72.00     72.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  345.00    350.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
